    LLM: 'Game: Zecchinetta. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: 'Zecchinetta (Lansquenet) is an Italian banking/gambling game. Banker vs players. 40-card Italian deck. Banker deals 2 player cards + 1 banker card face-up. Players bet on player cards. Banker draws cards: match player card = banker pays; match banker card = banker wins all bets. New unmatched cards become additional betting options.',
